plan_desc "                  General Wolf Rules for Life1. Eat (provide yourself w/ what your body needs to survive)2. Rest (re-charge yourself once in awhile)3. Rove in between (wander... don't live in one spot all your life)4. Render Loyalty (be loyal to others & let them be loyal to you)5. Love the Children (what else are you going to do?)6. Tune your ears (listen & pay attention to everything)7. Cavil in the moonlight8. Attend to the Bones (take care of yourself)9. Make Love10. Howl Often"
